<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31177" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρεσῐώνη</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶρος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>branch</i> of olive or laurel <i>wound round with wool
				and hung with fruits</i>, dedicated to Apollo and borne about
			by singing boys at the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πυανόψια</span>
			and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Θαργήλια</span>, while offerings were
			made to Helios and the Hours, and afterwards hung up at the
			house-door, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				729
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				399
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1054
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Paus.Gr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				157
			</span></i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> ll. cc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> the
			song itself, <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Thes.</u>
				22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>crown</i> hung up in honour of the dead, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				3.1337
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				3.37
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally,
				<i>wreath</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				3.10.4
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰρυσιώνη</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
